 "checked": "2026-10-18",
 "notes": "A flat, print-only form: answers are printed in the blank space of each line and an X goes in the circle or box chosen. Mapped are the lines every new business answers: identification (FEIN only; the SSN and visa number are never printed), the reason 'business entity not currently registered' with its first taxable date, name, location, mailing address, seasonal months, form of ownership (ownership names the form, its kind and, for an LLC, its tax treatment, which marks every circle that applies), dates, two directors or officers, the primary NAICS code, the business description, the sales and use tax activities, the secure email authorization and its contact, and the declaration's names. The other reasons for applying, sole proprietor and partner details (questions 7 and 8), background and prior owners (10 and 12), the rest of the sales and use tax section, reemployment tax (questions 20 to 28), communications services, documentary stamp, severance and gross receipts taxes, electronic filing enrollment, the signature and the date are left for the applicant.",
 "lines": [
